 * Central dispatcher for template-driven expression rewriting.
 *
 * TemplateExpressionRewriting is responsible for applying a TemplateMapper to
 * every expression node in the Ymir AST. It performs dynamic dispatch on the
 * concrete expression variant and forwards rewriting to the appropriate
 * specialized module.
